OL,3,ASales of baby sleeping bag halted by   
OL,4,ANext after new mum raises alarm        
OL,6,FSales of a baby sleeping bag have been 
OL,7,Fhalted in the UK by fashion retail     
OL,8,Fchain Next, after a new mum raised the 
OL,9,Falarm over its safety.                 
OL,11,FEmma Hunter, 29 from Norwich, contacted
OL,12,FBBC Your Voice to say she realised the 
OL,13,Fneck hole was far too big - meaning her
OL,14,Fdaughter Rosie could potentially       
OL,15,Fwriggle down, burying her face and     
OL,16,Frisking suffocation.                   
OL,18,FEmma recalls: "I woke up my husband and
OL,19,Fwe both agreed there was no way we     
OL,20,Fcould put Rosie in it."                
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
